{"unit_id":"gfds2005__dsh-timed-goal#card-zh","repo":"gfds2005/dsh-timed-goal","commit":"531edffcf2bf499e923b1fdb8b3dcb690fd8f265","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-timed-goal 是面向 DSH Web 的定时任务插件，可在单个对话中设置未来日期和提示词，到时创建并自动运行一个 Goal。它提供 /timed-goal 命令和对话输入框中的管理面板，支持本地时间或 UTC、每日重复、Goal 轮数限制，以及任务编辑、删除和列表查看。设置页还可跨会话浏览任务。任务保存在 DSH_HOME 下，适合希望定时启动对话任务的 DSH Web 用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:595-607","lib/index.js:616-655","src/client.js:791-804"]}
{"unit_id":"gfds2005__dsh-timed-goal#card-en","repo":"gfds2005/dsh-timed-goal","commit":"531edffcf2bf499e923b1fdb8b3dcb690fd8f265","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-timed-goal schedules prompts in DSH Web conversations and creates a Goal when a future time arrives. Use the /timed-goal command or composer panel to manage tasks. Schedules support UTC or local time, daily repeats, and a Goal-round limit. A settings section lists jobs across conversations.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:595-607","lib/index.js:616-655","src/client.js:791-804"]}
